 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2009) 'GitHub Container Registry ties package write access to the repository
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2009) 'whose `GITHUB_TOKEN` created it. The zone repo's token could not push to
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2009) 'a package owned by the baker repo, and could not pull a private package
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2009) 'owned by another repo without package-scoped access.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

