2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2009) 'Consequences
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2009) '- Package names must reflect the owning repo to avoid confusion.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2009) '- Moving a package between repos requires deleting it (needs
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2009) '  `delete:packages` API scope) and rebuilding, or renaming.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2009) '- Cross-repo GHCR access requires either a PAT with `read:packages`
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2009) '  scope or making the package public.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2009  1 LINE
 Text:Written

